## MCP — Configuration and Errors

### Where server config lives

| File             | Scope                                                 | Version control |
| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | --------------- |
| `.mcp.json`      | Shared/team servers, at the project root              | Committed       |
| `~/.claude.json` | Personal or throwaway servers, in your home directory | Kept out        |

### Error signalling

A failed call returns `isError: true`. Pair it with a **structured error
object** (category, retryable flag, message) so the agent can decide whether to
retry, rephrase, or escalate — a bare "operation failed" string gives it nothing
to act on.

