## Skills

Richer commands defined by `SKILL.md` frontmatter. Reach for them for
**on-demand, task-specific** work, and keep **always-on standards** in
`CLAUDE.md`.

Key frontmatter:

- **`context: fork`** — runs in an isolated sub-agent so noisy output stays out
  of the main session.
- **`allowed-tools`** — whitelists the tools the skill may use (a safety
  boundary, e.g. no deletes).
- **`argument-hint`** — prompts for an argument when the skill is invoked bare.

