## Message Batches API

Asynchronous bulk requests with up to a **24-hour turnaround** and **no
multi-turn tool calling**. The `custom_id` field ties each result back to its
source request, so when a few items fail you can resubmit just those by id
rather than the whole batch.

---

## Production Context Management

- **Don't lean on raw conversation history** — it frays under summarisation.
  Pull the must-keep facts into a structured block and re-include that block in
  every prompt.
- **Mind the lost-in-the-middle effect:** park the critical bits at the very top
  or bottom of the message, not buried in the middle.
- **For long investigations,** have the agent write findings to a
  `scratchpad.md`; when context degrades or a new session starts, it reads the
  scratchpad instead of rediscovering everything.
